{"duration_api_ms": 45344, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "session_id": "9598c597-b76f-4029-a330-6b523fbbd868", "total_cost_usd": 0.11833835999999999, "usage": {"input_tokens": 4, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4842, "cache_read_input_tokens": 59722, "output_tokens": 593, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4842, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 458, "cache_read_input_tokens": 30456, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3652, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3652}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "modelUsage": {"claude-sonnet-5-5": {"inputTokens": 10, "outputTokens": 1898, "cacheReadInputTokens": 128218, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 19653, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.11043379999999998, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 0, "canonicalModel": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}, "claude-haiku-5-5": {"inputTokens": 10, "outputTokens": 6522, "cacheReadInputTokens": 103981, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 28822, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.00790456, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 1888, "canonicalModel": "claude-haiku-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}}, "permission_denials": [], "terminal_reason": "completed", "fast_mode_state": "off", "fast_mode_disabled_reason": "sdk_opt_in_required", "origin": {"kind": "task-notification", "producer": "session-task", "runId": "0mvbel0oh-7abd6982"}, "subagent_stats": {"spawned": 1, "requested": {"background": 0, "foreground": 0, "unset": 1}, "started_in_background": 1, "max_depth": 1, "spawned_by_subagents": 0, "completed": 1, "failed": 0, "killed": {"parent": 0, "user": 0, "system": 0}, "refused": {"depth_limit": 0, "concurrency_limit": 0, "budget": 0}, "by_type": {"implementer": 1}}, "safety_stops": 0, "is_error": false, "num_turns": 2, "subtype": "success", "api_error_status": null, "result": "The three RCQ chip fixes are in, and all three checks pass: `pnpm --dir web test`, `pnpm --dir web exec tsc -b` and `pnpm --dir web lint`. I reviewed the diff and re-ran the checks myself. I did not run the repo's other pre-finish checks (`ruff`, `pytest`, `pnpm build`), since the change is frontend-only. I also didn't open the RCQ page in a browser.\n\n- **14-day window:** `RcqView.tsx` now reads the field over the last 14 days. The reset-based window and `useMetagameStatus` are gone, and the share note uses the wording from the spec.\n- **Summed shares:** `expectedOptions` in `rcq.ts` adds up the share of every label under a key at the chosen tier. A key with several labels (Azorius Control, Jeskai Control) is named by the key, and one with a single label by that label.\n- **\"Other\" chips:** `splitOptions` and `MAIN_SHARE = 0.02` put anything under 2% behind an `Other (N)` button in `InputsCard.tsx`. Picked chips stay visible, and the button toggles to `Fewer`.\n\nThe implementer deviated from the spec in one place. The button also stays visible while the list is expanded, even if nothing is hidden, so you can still collapse it. The spec's literal condition would remove the button in that case.", "ttft_ms": 1263, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 13143, "uuid": "d3058e98-65b9-47bf-bafe-e5f66dc60ed6", "ttft_stream_ms": 864, "time_to_request_ms": 18, "first_content_frame_ms": 865, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 1}
